    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Gary Machado",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105547796614339530689/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJWDp3MY_RJR520emno9rE8LdSLNEIEhD245gjj0foMhUcKun2hQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Paul from ABC came to the rescue when I noticed a lot of black ants going into the flashing of my front porch support pillars. I called them explaining the problem and mentioned winged ants coming in and out. They said it was most likely carpenter ants and the colony has been there for a few years. When Paul arrived he confirmed it and removed the flashing to expose the damage. He treated the area and found the queen to ensure the colony is dead. He pointed out the flashing wasn't installed correctly with the vinyl siding cause water to funnel into the support pillars through the soffit flashing. We managed to get someone a few days later to replace all the pillars, new flashing, caulk and fix the defective J channel in the siding. I'm very satisfied with the work performed and the same day service.",
        "time": 1659930397,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Justin Espinosa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118289788369647691864/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLd0ggE4UKkMvYjiSm_rq1UgWQIVY7kVV0aunXL01RdHtZ4unT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "This company is very professional, hands on and friendly, Specially the tech Matthew who is very approachable and will really tell you wheres the problem and how to solve it. I highly recommend this company, you can count on them!",
        "time": 1744645547,
        "translated": false
      },
