        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Very reasonable price and excellent service. I highly recommend this company, do not bother with the others, they are mostly scammers. I had a wonderful experience with this company, and the technician was very knowledgeable and kind. I personally think he did an excellent job in all areas and I cannot say enough nice things about this company and service I received! I highly recommend them! Thank you!",
